 "chunks": [
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 0.25,
   "end": 2.421,
   "text": "In 2023, people tried to pull"
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 2.421,
   "end": 5.797,
   "text": "$42 BILLION out of ONE bank, in ONE DAY."
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 5.937,
   "end": 7.43,
   "text": "The next day, it was SHUT DOWN."
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 7.57,
   "end": 9.874,
   "text": "So what if EVERYONE took their money out AT ONCE?"
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 10.174,
   "end": 11.155,
   "text": "Here's the SECRET."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 11.295,
   "end": 12.895,
   "text": "Your money ISN'T sitting in a vault."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 13.035,
   "end": 14.321,
   "text": "Banks LEND most of it out,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 14.321,
   "end": 16.746,
   "text": "for HOUSES, CARS, and BUSINESSES,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 16.746,
   "end": 18.902,
   "text": "and keep only a SMALL SLICE as cash."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 20.0,
   "end": 21.0,
   "text": "That works because people"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 21.0,
   "end": 23.157,
   "text": "don't all withdraw on the SAME DAY."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 23.297,
   "end": 25.127,
   "text": "But if everyone PANICS at once,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 25.127,
   "end": 25.921,
   "text": "the cash RUNS OUT."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 26.061,
   "end": 27.277,
   "text": "That's called a BANK RUN."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 30.0,
   "end": 31.999,
   "text": "To pay people back, the bank has to SELL"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 31.999,
   "end": 34.715,
   "text": "its investments FAST, sometimes at a LOSS."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 34.855,
   "end": 37.074,
   "text": "And when people at OTHER BANKS see the panic,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 37.074,
   "end": 38.225,
   "text": "they start RUNNING TOO."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 38.525,
   "end": 40.186,
   "text": "In the 1930s GREAT DEPRESSION,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 40.186,
   "end": 41.555,
   "text": "about 9,000 BANKS failed."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 41.695,
   "end": 45.193,
   "text": "So in 1933, America created the FDIC."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 45.333,
   "end": 49.749,
   "text": "It insures up to $250,000 per depositor, per bank."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 50.049,
   "end": 51.897,
   "text": "Since then, NO ONE has lost a PENNY"
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 51.897,
   "end": 52.844,
   "text": "of insured money."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 52.984,
   "end": 55.16,
   "text": "And the Fed can lend banks EMERGENCY CASH."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 55.3,
   "end": 56.751,
   "text": "It's WORKING, and it's PROTECTED."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 56.891,
   "end": 57.851,
   "text": "FOLLOW for more!"
  }
 ]
